Z||000003||Eric_PA||04-05-2001||11:48 PM||||Nothing like a few farmer tools around the garage. Was cleaning up and decided to toss them under the car   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Ok...honestly I was looking for a sledge hammer to make the other side match. Just couldn't do that with a rubber mallet. The vice grips where great for keeping the brake lines from leaking all over the floor  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Take note to my spring safety chain in the back. I guess the rope would have been strong enough to hold it in there if it let loose.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>hahaha JK... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> except for the rope thing.<BR>Eric<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Eric_PA (edited 04-05-2001).]||||reg||10
